egui-gizmo
==========

This crate vendors and adapts the core of `transform-gizmo` 0.9.0:

    transform-gizmo
    Copyright (c) Urho Laukkarinen <urho.laukkarinen@gmail.com>
    Licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0
    https://github.com/urholaukkarinen/transform-gizmo

The vendored modules (`src/math.rs`, `src/config.rs`, `src/gizmo.rs`,
`src/shape.rs`, `src/subgizmo.rs`, `src/subgizmo/*.rs`) are derived works of
`transform-gizmo` and remain under MIT OR Apache-2.0. They have been adapted to:

  - internalise all math to `glam` f64 (the upstream `mint` dependency is removed),
  - depend only on `egui` + `glam` (the separate `ecolor` / `emath` / `epaint`
    and `ahash` dependencies are removed),
  - expose a clean glam-f32 public facade in `src/egui_gizmo.rs`.

The public facade (`src/egui_gizmo.rs`) and these adaptations are part of
egui-gizmo and are licensed BSD-3-Clause.
